    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. One thing that keeps coming up in my research is the environmental side of it. Given the climate crisis and the measurable impact of idling traffic on air quality, is congestion pricing generally viewed by experts as a necessary step, or is it still being treated as just one of many optional policy tools?",
