    "summary": "The user asks a series of increasingly specific questions regarding the urban mobility policy of congestion pricing, focusing on equity and environmental necessity. While the assistant begins with a balanced overview of proponents and critics, it shifts toward a normative stance in the final response, characterizing the policy as a \"necessary\" tool for serious climate advocates.",
